{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","干劲满满"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Full Energy"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","使友军获得短暂的伤害减免和属性加成。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Koko grants allies a brief DMG Reduction and stats boost."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","鼓舞自己和全体友军使他们获得暂时的45%伤害减免持续12秒并记录被减免的伤害值，在持续时间结束后这部分伤害值会一次性以真实伤害结算。在此期间，友军们还会获得30 + 3点生命汲取和10%攻击力加成。该效果不可被驱散，且在效果持续期间无法再次释放本技能。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Koko inspires herself and all allies, granting them a 45% DMG Reduction for 12s and recording the amount of damage reduced. After the duration of Full Energy ends, the recorded damage will be dealt as true damage to all allies. When the skill takes effect, allies gain 30 + 3 Life Drain and 10% ATK. While active, the effect cannot be dispelled and prevents Koko from recasting the skill."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":80,"end":84,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":271,"end":275,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害减免效果提升至50%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the DMG Reduction effect to 50%."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害减免效果提升至55%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the DMG Reduction effect to 55%."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","获得的生命汲取提升至35 + 3。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases gained Life Drain to 35 + 3."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":33,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","获得的生命汲取提升至40 + 3。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases gained Life Drain to 40 + 3."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":33,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","大口吞肉"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Fulfilling Feast"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用肉投喂友军或自身，恢复生命值同时提升部分属性。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Koko feeds an ally or herself with meat, recovering HP and increasing some stats."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","投喂最虚弱的1名友军，使其恢复-230% − 20% ATK生命值，并提升10%攻击力，持续5秒。另外，每隔15秒，额外投喂自己坐骑“帕托”恢复自身350% ATK生命值，并提升20点受击回能，持续7秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Koko feeds the weakest ally, healing them by -230% − 20% ATK HP and granting them 10% ATK for 5s. Koko also feeds Patto to recover 350% ATK HP every 15s, increasing 20 Energy on Hit for 7s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":2,"end":6,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":15,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":74,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":15,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":45,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":131,"end":139,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","使友军恢复-240% − 20% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Recovers -240% − 20% ATK HP for allies."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","使友军恢复-250% − 20% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Recovers -250% − 20% ATK HP for allies."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","使友军恢复-260% − 20% ATK生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Recovers -260% − 20% ATK HP for allies."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":9,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","帕托出击"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Patto, smash!"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","造成高额伤害和减益效果。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Koko deals high-value damage and inflicts debuffs."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","向当前目标投掷超级长矛造成210% + 15% ATK伤害，并使目标在后续的5秒内受到的伤害提升10%。另外，当自身相邻格子内有敌人时，叶角熊“帕托”砸向地面，使附近1格范围内的敌人受到210% + 15% ATK伤害，并眩晕3秒，该效果每8秒至多触发一次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Koko throws a mighty spear at the target, dealing 210% + 15% ATK damage and increasing their damage taken by 10% in the next 5s. If there's an enemy within her adjacent tiles, Patto will smash the ground, dealing 210% + 15% ATK damage to adjacent enemies and stunning them for 3s. This effect can only be triggered once every 8s."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":97,"end":103,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":60,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":217,"end":223,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":93,"end":107,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":50,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":213,"end":227,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至220% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 220% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至230% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 230% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至240% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 240% + 15% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases Haste during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升12点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 12 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 16 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升20点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 20 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","毛绒加护"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Fluffy Shield"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","终极技能能够获得额外护盾。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Koko gains an extra shield when casting Ultimate."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“干劲满满”中所记录的伤害结算后，全体友军获得所有受“干劲满满”影响的友军在该技能持续期间造成的总伤害15%的护盾，持续7秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","After the damage recorded in Full Energy has been settled, all allies gain a shield for 7s that can absorb damage equal to 15% of the total damage dealt by allies affected by Full Energy when it's active."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾量提升至20%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 20%."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“干劲满满”释放瞬间，解除己方全体受到的的控制效果，并在持续期间获得20点韧性。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Removes all allied heroes' control effects when casting Full Energy, gaining 20 Resilience when the skill takes effect."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","在持续期间获得30点韧性。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Gains 30 Resilience when the skill takes effect."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“大口吞肉”中被投喂的目标提升受愈持续一段时间。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases the target's Vitality for a while after Koko feeds them using Fulfilling Feast."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“大口吞肉”中被投喂的目标提升25点受愈持续6秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases the target's Vitality by 25 for 6s after Koko feeds them using Fulfilling Feast."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","砂骨猎矛"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Bone Spear"]]}